{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20128","headline":"送淡公 一 · 孟郊","name":"送淡公 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"燕本冰雪骨，越淡莲花风。\n五言双宝刀，联响高飞鸿。\n翰苑钱舍人，诗韵铿雷公。\n识本未识淡，仰咏嗟无穷。\n清恨生物表，朗玉倾梦中。\n常於冷竹坐，相语道意冲。\n嵩洛兴不薄，稽江事难同。\n明年若不来，我作黄蒿翁。\n何以兀其心爲君学虚空。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20128.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20128","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}